---- (** Slight Spoiler **) ----
(The real question was how to keep your dog from eating that 
Leprechaun corpse you've finally managed to deanimate.)
Here's a little fortune cookie hint that comes in handy in some 
such situations:  dogs will not step on cursed items.  Rings seem
to be cursed a good percentage of the time.  Hunt around for a 
ring or some other cursed item (the little doggie won't pick it
up), and drop it out in the hallway along with you gold.  By placing
this little obstacle strategically, you can prevent the dog from
ever entering the room in which you do battle with the Leppie.
Of course, this doesn't work in every situation.  If the room 
has more than one entrance, it may be impossible to keep the dog
out.  And, of course, it's possible that you won't have come 
across any cursed items when the moment of truth arrives.  Still,
if you really are interested in keeping the dog around, it's an
effective technique.


